  'Goal 用于一个需要跨多个轮次持续推进的同会话目标。它与普通 Todo 不同：Goal 有 phase、revision、Round 上限和明确的暂停、恢复、完成与阻塞生命周期。': 'A goal represents one same-session objective that needs progress across multiple rounds. Unlike a todo list, it has a phase, revision, round limit, and explicit pause, resume, complete, and blocked lifecycle.',
  'Goal Round 只在 Agent idle、目标仍 active 且有剩余容量时追加；人类消息优先且不消耗 Round。恢复会话或 fork 后，自动续行默认停用，必须由用户明确恢复。': 'A goal round is appended only while the agent is idle, the goal remains active, and capacity remains. Human messages take priority and consume no round. Automatic continuation is disarmed after session resume or fork until a user explicitly resumes it.',
  '完成需要证据': 'Completion requires evidence',
  '模型必须读取精确 goal id 与 revision 后再更新。困难或不确定不是阻塞；只有同一阻碍连续达到配置阈值后才能报告 blocked。': 'The model must read the exact goal ID and revision before updating. Difficulty or uncertainty is not blocked; only the same obstacle persisting for the configured threshold may be reported as blocked.',
  'Basic Compaction 在上下文压力达到阈值时，把较早的完整历史单元替换为结构化检查点，同时逐字保留近期尾部。默认阈值为模型上下文窗口的 80%，近期保留预算为 16%。': 'Basic compaction replaces older complete history units with a structured checkpoint when context pressure reaches its threshold, while preserving the recent tail verbatim. Defaults are 80% of the model context window for pressure and 16% for recent retention.',
  '超大工具结果可先经过不依赖模型的剪枝；若压力仍高，再调用摘要模型。摘要只保存文本，不保留私有推理或遗留工具调用。压缩会替换历史，因此会移动 KV Cache 的可复用边界。': 'Oversized tool results can first be pruned without a model. If pressure remains high, a summarization model runs. The checkpoint stores text only, excluding private reasoning and orphaned tool calls. Compaction replaces history and therefore moves the reusable KV-cache boundary.',
