  '当 Agent 缺少会实质改变结果的信息时，可以通过结构化问题暂停并等待人类回答。每个问题带稳定 id，可提供单选、多选、自由文本和补充说明；回答仍按 id 返回，避免批量提问时依赖位置。': 'When an agent lacks information that would materially change the result, it can pause with a structured question and wait for a human answer. Each question has a stable ID and may offer single choice, multiple choice, free text, and supporting detail; answers return by ID so batches never depend on position.',
